	(text_box "## System Summary\n\nThe PDB distributes three battery domains:\n\n| Domain | Input | Purpose |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Logic / Comms | 22.2 V / 6S LiPo | Jetson, network switch, 24V POE antenna, RP2350 housekeeping, aux output |\n| Drivetrain | 14.4 V / 4S LiPo | Six independently switched motor-controller outputs |\n| Arm / Science | 14.4 V / 4S LiPo | Independent ARM and SCIENCE switched outputs |\n\nThe PCB is controlled by the fprime-billee-rcm firmware, running Fprime-zephyr. A released build can be accessed within this projects repo as a submodule."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 313.69 153.035 0)
		(size 266.7 51.6417)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
